      "sender": "dlloveras",
      "body": "I need to establish a trainable baseline. I will use it to establish performance in a validation dataset and later I will train Surya to try to outperform the baseline.\nI have 2 ideas. First using a probability that the image is a CME or not. Just a variable.\nSecond, I wanto to calculate a running difference (the difference between consecutive images, consecutive batch) I want to take aia 193 t1 - t0. Use a mean averge pool using a kernel 32x32 with fixel values of 1/(32x32). then apply a logistic regresion with trainable parameters. ",
      "raw_time": false,
