            "raw_output": "=== downstream_apps ===\ntotal 16\ndrwxrwsr-x.  4 jovyan users 4096 Sep 10 20:45 .\ndrwxrwsr-x.  8 jovyan users 4096 Sep 15 13:36 ..\ndrwxrwsr-x. 10 jovyan users 4096 Sep 14 17:38 template\ndrwxrwsr-x. 12 jovyan users 4096 Sep 15 16:14 test\n=== template ===\n/home/jovyan/surya_workshop2026/downstream_apps/template/0_dataset_dataloader_template.ipynb\n/home/jovyan/surya_workshop2026/downstream_apps/template/1_baseline_template.ipynb\n/home/jovyan/surya_workshop2026/downstream_apps/template/2_finetune_template_1D.ipynb\n/home/jovyan/surya_workshop2026/downstream_apps/template/3_finetune_template_1D.py\n/home/jovyan/surya_workshop2026/downstream_apps/template/ADAPTING.md\n/home/jovyan/surya_workshop2026/downstream_apps/template/A_shapes_and_broadcasting.ipynb\n/home/jovyan/surya_workshop2026/downstream_apps/template/__pycache__/configs.cpython-312.pyc\n/home/jovyan/surya_workshop2026/downstream_apps/template/assets/.gitkeep\n/home/jovyan/surya_workshop2026/downstream_apps/template/configs.py\n/home/jovyan/surya_workshop2026/downstream_apps/template/configs/config_script.yaml\n/home/jovyan/surya_workshop2026/downstream_apps/template/data/.ipynb_checkpoints/hek_flare_catalog-checkpoint.csv\n/home/jovyan/surya_workshop2026/downstream_apps/template/data/hek_flare_catalog.csv\n/home/jovyan/surya_workshop2026/downstream_apps/template/datasets/__init__.py\n/home/jovyan/surya_workshop2026/downstream_apps/template/datasets/template_dataset.py\n/home/jovyan/surya_workshop2026/downstream_apps/template/download_scalers.sh\n/home/jovyan/surya_workshop2026/downstream_apps/template/download_scalers_and_weights.sh\n/home/jovyan/surya_workshop2026/downstream_apps/template/lightning_modules/__init__.py\n/home/jovyan/surya_workshop2026/downstream_apps/template/lightning_modules/pl_simple_baseline.py\n/home/jovyan/surya_workshop2026/downstream_apps/template/metrics/__init__.py\n/home/jovyan/surya_workshop2026/downstream_apps/template/metrics/template_metrics.py\n/home/jovyan/surya_workshop2026/downstream_apps/template/models/__init__.py\n/home/jovyan/surya_workshop2026/downstream_apps/template/models/simple_baseline.py",
