            "raw_output": "=== test app siblings ===\n/home/jovyan/surya_workshop2026/downstream_apps/test\n/home/jovyan/surya_workshop2026/downstream_apps/test/.ipynb_checkpoints\n/home/jovyan/surya_workshop2026/downstream_apps/test/__pycache__\n/home/jovyan/surya_workshop2026/downstream_apps/test/assets\n/home/jovyan/surya_workshop2026/downstream_apps/test/assets/.cache\n/home/jovyan/surya_workshop2026/downstream_apps/test/configs\n/home/jovyan/surya_workshop2026/downstream_apps/test/configs/.ipynb_checkpoints\n/home/jovyan/surya_workshop2026/downstream_apps/test/data\n/home/jovyan/surya_workshop2026/downstream_apps/test/data/.ipynb_checkpoints\n/home/jovyan/surya_workshop2026/downstream_apps/test/datasets\n/home/jovyan/surya_workshop2026/downstream_apps/test/datasets/.ipynb_checkpoints\n/home/jovyan/surya_workshop2026/downstream_apps/test/datasets/__pycache__\n/home/jovyan/surya_workshop2026/downstream_apps/test/lightning_modules\n/home/jovyan/surya_workshop2026/downstream_apps/test/lightning_modules/.ipynb_checkpoints\n/home/jovyan/surya_workshop2026/downstream_apps/test/logs\n/home/jovyan/surya_workshop2026/downstream_apps/test/logs/data\n/home/jovyan/surya_workshop2026/downstream_apps/test/metrics\n/home/jovyan/surya_workshop2026/downstream_apps/test/metrics/.ipynb_checkpoints\n/home/jovyan/surya_workshop2026/downstream_apps/test/models\n/home/jovyan/surya_workshop2026/downstream_apps/test/models/.ipynb_checkpoints\n\n/home/jovyan/surya_workshop2026/downstream_apps/test/0_dataset_dataloader_template.ipynb\n/home/jovyan/surya_workshop2026/downstream_apps/test/0_dataset_dataloader_template_diego.ipynb\n/home/jovyan/surya_workshop2026/downstream_apps/test/1_baseline_template.ipynb\n/home/jovyan/surya_workshop2026/downstream_apps/test/1_baseline_template_diego.ipynb\n/home/jovyan/surya_workshop2026/downstream_apps/test/2_finetune_template_1D.ipynb\n/home/jovyan/surya_workshop2026/downstream_apps/test/3_finetune_template_1D.py\n/home/jovyan/surya_workshop2026/downstream_apps/test/ADAPTING.md\n/home/jovyan/surya_workshop2026/downstream_apps/test/A_shapes_and_broadcasting.ipynb\n/home/jovyan/surya_workshop2026/downstream_apps/test/configs.py\n/home/jovyan/surya_workshop2026/downstream_apps/test/download_scalers.sh\n/home/jovyan/surya_workshop2026/downstream_apps/test/download_scalers_and_weights.sh\n/home/jovyan/surya_workshop2026/downstream_apps/test/untitled.chat",
