            "title": "cd surya_workshop2026 && grep -rn \"wandb\" --include=\"*.py\" workshop_infrastructure downstream_apps/test | grep -v \".ipynb_checkpoints\"",
            "raw_output": "workshop_infrastructure/configs.py:216:    wandb_project: str = \"surya_downstream\"\nworkshop_infrastructure/configs.py:217:    wandb_entity: Optional[str] = None\nworkshop_infrastructure/configs.py:376:        wandb_project=logging_cfg.get(\"wandb_project\", \"surya_downstream\"),\nworkshop_infrastructure/configs.py:377:        wandb_entity=logging_cfg.get(\"wandb_entity\"),\nworkshop_infrastructure/configs.py:387:_LOGGING_KEYS = frozenset({\"wandb_project\", \"wandb_entity\"})\ndownstream_apps/test/3_finetune_template_1D.py:75:    parser.add_argument(\"--no-wandb\", action=\"store_true\",\ndownstream_apps/test/3_finetune_template_1D.py:195:    no_wandb: bool = False,\ndownstream_apps/test/3_finetune_template_1D.py:202:    if not no_wandb:\ndownstream_apps/test/3_finetune_template_1D.py:204:            entity=cfg.wandb_entity,  # None = personal account; set in YAML for team runs\ndownstream_apps/test/3_finetune_template_1D.py:205:            project=cfg.wandb_project,\ndownstream_apps/test/3_finetune_template_1D.py:208:            save_dir=os.environ.get(\"TMPDIR\", \"./wandb/wandb_tmp\"),\ndownstream_apps/test/3_finetune_template_1D.py:275:    trainer, checkpoint_cb = build_trainer(cfg, no_wandb=args.no_wandb, max_epochs_override=args.max_epochs)\nShell cwd was reset to /home/jovyan/surya_workshop2026/downstream_apps/test",
            "selected_option_id": "allow-once",
            "tool_call_id": "toolu_bdrk_01ThU7CrMhQqc3fQAHcLkZhN",
