    {
      "body": "Good \u2014 no trace of that key in git history, checkpoints, or the current file. It's not committed and not on disk anywhere else I can find. Since it's not in git history, no rotation is strictly required, but since it was pasted in plaintext at least once, I'd still recommend rotating it out of caution \u2014 your call. Now continuing the notebook run from the top with the fresh kernel.",
      "mentions": [],
