            "raw_output": "{\"result\":\"### Cell 39\\n\\n#### Metadata\\n\\n```yaml\\nexecution_count: 21\\ntype: code\\n```\\n\\n#### Source\\n\\n```python\\nmax_epochs = 4\\n\\n# -------------------------------------------------------------------------\\n# Trainer \u2014 one per baseline, so each gets its own checkpoint/logger state and their\\n# validation metrics are directly comparable side by side.\\n# -------------------------------------------------------------------------\\ntrainer_constant = L.Trainer(\\n    max_epochs=max_epochs,\\n    accelerator=\\\"auto\\\",\\n    devices=\\\"auto\\\",\\n    logger=make_loggers(\\\"baseline_constant_prob\\\"),\\n    callbacks=[ModelCheckpoint(monitor=\\\"val_loss\\\", mode=\\\"min\\\", save_top_k=1)],\\n    log_every_n_steps=2,\\n)\\n\\ntrainer_running_diff = L.Trainer(\\n    max_epochs=max_epochs,\\n    accelerator=\\\"auto\\\",\\n    devices=\\\"auto\\\",\\n    logger=make_loggers(\\\"baseline_running_diff\\\"),\\n    callbacks=[ModelCheckpoint(monitor=\\\"val_loss\\\", mode=\\\"min\\\", save_top_k=1)],\\n    log_every_n_steps=2,\\n)\\n```\\n\\n#### Output\\n\\n```\\nGPU available: True (cuda), used: True\\n```\\n\\n```\\nTPU available: False, using: 0 TPU cores\\n```\\n\\n```\\n\ud83d\udca1 Tip: For seamless cloud logging and experiment tracking, try installing [litlogger](https://pypi.org/project/litlogger/) to enable LitLogger, which logs metrics and artifacts automatically to the Lightning Experiments platform.\\n```\\n\\n```\\nGPU available: True (cuda), used: True\\n```\\n\\n```\\nTPU available: False, using: 0 TPU cores\\n```\\n\\n```\\n\ud83d\udca1 Tip: For seamless cloud logging and experiment tracking, try installing [litlogger](https://pypi.org/project/litlogger/) to enable LitLogger, which logs metrics and artifacts automatically to the Lightning Experiments platform.\\n```\"}",
