    {
      "time": 1789584119.7021446,
      "id": "f0606625-2f43-4047-b016-d86ac6a9c439",
      "type": "msg",
      "mentions": [],
      "raw_time": false,
      "sender": "jupyter-ai-personas::jupyter_ai_acp_client::ClaudeAcpPersona",
      "body": "Confirmed working \u2014 `trainer_constant`/`trainer_running_diff` now build cleanly with `max_epochs = cfg.max_epochs` (= 20, from the YAML), no errors.\n\nTo pick up both changes (LR 0.01 + 20 epochs), re-run from `f8a6e448` (`trainer_constant.fit(...)`) through `5dd75610` (`trainer_running_diff.fit(...)`) \u2014 since `cfg` was already loaded earlier in the kernel, it'll pick up the new `learning_rate`/`max_epochs` without needing a full kernel restart."
