      "body": "Just re-running block 45 alone won't pick up the new LR/epochs \u2014 `cfg` was loaded from disk before I edited the YAML, and `lit_model_running_diff`/`trainer_running_diff` were built from that stale `cfg`. I'll refresh the whole chain first, then run block 45.",
