            "raw_output": "########## /home/jovyan/surya_workshop2026/downstream_apps/test/wandb/wandb_tmp/wandb/run-20260916_140024-l6g73kau/\n2026-09-16 14:00:24,656 INFO    MainThread:622 [wandb_init.py:init():846] wandb.init called with sweep_config: {}\n########## /home/jovyan/surya_workshop2026/downstream_apps/test/wandb/wandb_tmp/wandb/run-20260916_142431-hqu41y5y/\n2026-09-16 14:24:31,869 INFO    MainThread:622 [wandb_init.py:init():846] wandb.init called with sweep_config: {}\n########## /home/jovyan/surya_workshop2026/downstream_apps/test/wandb/wandb_tmp/wandb/run-20260916_143052-vab9n0kt/\n2026-09-16 14:30:52,558 INFO    MainThread:622 [wandb_init.py:init():846] wandb.init called with sweep_config: {}\n########## /home/jovyan/surya_workshop2026/downstream_apps/test/wandb/wandb_tmp/wandb/run-20260916_144729-60d6k5b2/\n2026-09-16 14:47:29,303 INFO    MainThread:622 [wandb_init.py:init():846] wandb.init called with sweep_config: {}\n########## /home/jovyan/surya_workshop2026/downstream_apps/test/wandb/wandb_tmp/wandb/run-20260916_152657-0pzw0ulg/\n2026-09-16 15:26:57,981 INFO    MainThread:1665 [wandb_init.py:init():846] wandb.init called with sweep_config: {}\n########## /home/jovyan/surya_workshop2026/downstream_apps/test/wandb/wandb_tmp/wandb/run-20260916_204339-vy1af90b/\n2026-09-16 20:43:39,368 INFO    MainThread:395 [wandb_init.py:init():846] wandb.init called with sweep_config: {}\n########## /home/jovyan/surya_workshop2026/downstream_apps/test/wandb/run-20260916_143401-ueib5ss4/\n2026-09-16 14:34:01,480 INFO    MainThread:622 [wandb_init.py:init():846] wandb.init called with sweep_config: {}\n########## /home/jovyan/surya_workshop2026/downstream_apps/test/wandb/run-20260916_143826-3ozdafca/\n2026-09-16 14:38:26,266 INFO    MainThread:622 [wandb_init.py:init():846] wandb.init called with sweep_config: {}"
