 21:12 /home/jovyan/surya_workshop2026/downstream_apps/test/logs/data/20260916T202602Z_000_data_train_500.log\n-rw-rw-r--. 1 jovyan users 662 Sep 15 21:03 /home/jovyan/surya_workshop2026/downstream_apps/test/logs/data/20260915T205733Z_000_data_val_2611.log\n-rw-rw-r--. 1 jovyan users 17702 Sep 16 15:19 /home/jovyan/surya_workshop2026/downstream_apps/test/logs/data/20260916T135718Z_000_data_train_622.log\n-rw-rw-r--. 1 jovyan users 5225 Sep 16 21:12 /home/jovyan/surya_workshop2026/downstream_apps/test/logs/data/20260916T202602Z_000_data_train_534.log\n-rw-rw-r--. 1 jovyan users 4510 Sep 16 21:11 /home/jovyan/surya_workshop2026/downstream_apps/test/logs/data/20260916T204400Z_000_data_val_838.log",
