n.Parameter) -> torch.Tensor:\n268:                if self.time_embedding[\"type\"] == \"perceiver\":\n317:                if self.time_embedding[\"type\"] == \"perceiver\":\nShell cwd was reset to /home/jovyan/surya_workshop2026/downstream_apps/test",
