16:17 README.md\ndrwxrwsr-x.  3 jovyan users  4096 Sep 10 20:36 data\ndrwxrwsr-x.  4 jovyan users  4096 Sep 10 20:45 downstream_apps\n-rw-rw-r--.  1 jovyan users   718 Sep 10 20:36 environment.yml\n-rw-rw-r--.  1 jovyan users    87 Sep 16 16:17 requirements.txt\ndrwxrwsr-x.  2 jovyan users  4096 Sep 16 16:17 tests\ndrwxrwsr-x.  7 jovyan users  4096 Sep 16 16:17 workshop_infrastructure"
