      "body": "Key number: **15.2 s of CPU per sample** (2\u00d74.7 s EFS+HDF5 read, 4.7 s signum-log, 0.4 s z-score). So data loading and GPU compute are nearly *balanced* \u2014 this needs \u22655 workers just to keep the GPU fed, and it changes both my worker config and my epoch estimates. Let me correct the plan.",
