            "raw_output": "231:def discover_head_modules(model: torch.nn.Module) -> list[str]:\n303:def apply_peft_lora(\n383:def load_pretrained_weights(model: torch.nn.Module, pretrained_path: Optional[str]) -> None:\n414:class UploadBestCheckpointToS3(L.Callback):\nShell cwd was reset to /home/jovyan/surya_workshop2026/downstream_apps/test"
