          {
            "title": "cd surya_workshop2026 && mkdir -p sumtest && cp downstream_apps/test/experiments/results/smoke_n8_summary.json  && python -u -m downstream_apps.test.experiments.summarize_results --results-dir sumtest --runs-dir runs 2>&1 | grep -vE \"Warning|warn\"; echo \"=== files ===\"; ls ",
            "tool_call_id": "toolu_bdrk_01VCKGCQY6s2c3shuikNRjun",
            "kind": "execute",
            "raw_output": "[out] /tmp/sumtest/val_loss_vs_n.png\n[out] /tmp/sumtest/task_2_4_answer.md\n# Task 2.4 \u2014 does validation loss improve as more images are used?\n\nBase rate for a balanced binary task is `ln 2 = 0.6931`. Any loss at or above that is a model that has learned nothing about the input.\n\n## Surya + LoRA\n\n| N (train) | epochs | best val BCE | val acc | val AUROC | test BCE | test acc | test AUROC |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 8 | 1 | 0.7284 | 0.458 | 0.542 | 0.7065 | 0.521 | 0.610 |\n\n## Answer\n\nGoing from N=8 to N=8, best validation BCE rose by 0.0000 (0.7284 \u2192 0.7284), so on this evidence more images **do not** improve validation loss over the range tested.\n\n0 of 1 runs beat the base rate. No configuration beat the base rate, so nothing here has yet demonstrated that the input is predictive at this sample size \u2014 the ranking of the runs is not meaningful until one of them does.\n\n**Caveat that limits every number above:** the validation split is 24 samples, so one sample is 4.2% of the metric and differences smaller than roughly 0.05 in BCE are not resolvable. The 48-sample test column is the more trustworthy comparison, and it was looked at once, after checkpoint selection.\n\n## Figures\n\n- `val_loss_vs_n.png` \u2014 the headline curve plus the iso-compute view\n- `baseline_study.png` \u2014 task 1.2, the baseline learning curve and sweeps\n- `task_1_1_wave_visibility.png` \u2014 task 1.1, matched pairs\n- `wave_visibility_scan.png` \u2014 contrast vs where the positive is sampled\n=== files ===\nsmoke_n8_summary.json\ntask_2_4_answer.md\nval_loss_vs_n.png\nShell cwd was reset to /home/jovyan/surya_workshop2026/downstream_apps/test",
            "raw_input": {
