    {
      "sender": "dlloveras",
      "body": "I want to write the cells in 1_baseline*diego that runs the baseline. fix the training dataset and validation dataset. So I can use the same in 2_finetune*diego, later.\nTrain the baseline using the new code in simple_baseline. Modify the existing cells. use wandb to train the model and visualize the output there. ask questions if necessary.",
