            "raw_output": "total 768\ndrwxrwsr-x.  5 jovyan users   4096 Sep 17 19:33 .\ndrwxrwsr-x. 15 jovyan users   4096 Sep 17 19:43 ..\ndrwxr-sr-x.  2 jovyan users   4096 Sep 17 19:07 .ipynb_checkpoints\n-rw-rw-r--.  1 jovyan users   5897 Sep 17 16:00 README.md\n-rw-rw-r--.  1 jovyan users      0 Sep 17 15:10 __init__.py\ndrwxrwsr-x.  2 jovyan users   4096 Sep 17 16:52 __pycache__\n-rw-rw-r--.  1 jovyan users  15302 Sep 17 16:46 extract_baseline_features.py\n-rw-rw-r--.  1 jovyan users   7099 Sep 17 16:06 plot_task_1_1.py\ndrwxrwsr-x.  5 jovyan users   4096 Sep 17 18:15 results\n-rw-rw-r--.  1 jovyan users  21995 Sep 17 16:52 run_baseline_study.py\n-rwxrwxr-x.  1 jovyan users   9983 Sep 17 16:22 run_surya_schedule.sh\n-rw-rw-r--.  1 jovyan users  12395 Sep 17 16:31 summarize_results.py\n-rw-r--r--.  1 jovyan users 629424 Sep 17 19:33 untitled.chat\n-rw-rw-r--.  1 jovyan users  29111 Sep 17 16:10 wave_common.py\n-rw-rw-r--.  1 jovyan users  15361 Sep 17 16:49 wave_visibility_scan.py\n/home/jovyan/surya_workshop2026/downstream_apps/test/4_finetune_wave_1D.py:270:    train_ds, val_ds, test_ds = wc.build_wave_datasets(\n/home/jovyan/surya_workshop2026/downstream_apps/test/4_finetune_wave_1D.py:282:        info = wc.event_stratified_subset(ds, n_samples=n, seed=args.subset_seed)\n/home/jovyan/surya_workshop2026/downstream_apps/test/4_finetune_wave_1D.py:284:        print(f\"[DATA] {name}: {info.describe()}\")\n/home/jovyan/surya_workshop2026/downstream_apps/test/experiments/wave_visibility_scan.py:180:    train_ds, _ = wc.build_wave_datasets(cfg, scalers)\n/home/jovyan/surya_workshop2026/downstream_apps/test/experiments/wave_visibility_scan.py:181:    info = wc.event_stratified_subset(train_ds, n_samples=None, seed=args.subset_seed)\n/home/jovyan/surya_workshop2026/downstream_apps/test/experiments/wave_visibility_scan.py:182:    print(f\"[scan] train pool: {info.describe()}\")\n/home/jovyan/surya_workshop2026/downstream_apps/test/experiments/wave_visibility_scan.py: