      "sender": "jupyter-ai-personas::jupyter_ai_acp_client::ClaudeAcpPersona",
      "body": "Very useful \u2014 and one finding changes everything: **you rewrote `RunningDifferenceLogisticModel`**. It's now a 2-parameter logistic regression on a single scalar (`mean(|pool\u2083\u2082(now \u2212 prev)|)`), with signature `(channel_index, pool_kernel=32)` \u2014 no `img_size`. Let me confirm the details and the blast radius.",
      "id": "48eff3e0-f7a8-423f-a0be-d2934a7c4ff6",
      "time": 1789674405.0871797,
      "type": "msg",
